{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Slurp it loud —|silence means you hate it."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Polite silence.|Chef panics."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same hands.|Slurp it loud."},{"id":"s5","text":"Loud slurp.|Chef grins."},{"id":"s6","text":"He shouted—"},{"id":"s7","text":"He cooks on.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Bowl empty.|Chef beams."},{"id":"s9","text":"Loud means love.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"Silence worries|the chef."},{"id":"n2","text":"Slurp loud.|It means delicious."},{"id":"n3","text":"Empty bowl.|Best compliment."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}